  "title": "Avocado and Grapefruit Salad with Mint-Dill Vinaigrette",
  "description": "This avocado and grapefruit salad is just as delicious as it is beautiful with its fresh mint-dill vinaigrette and the addition of tangy hibiscus salt.",
